{"seq":3,"slug":"reship-cost-sla-service-metric","title":"补发成本/SLA/一次解决率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-fraud-recovery/reship-cost-sla-service-metric","wordCount":2244,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"补发成本-sla-一次解决率度量\">补发成本/SLA/一次解决率度量</h1><p>度量决定了行为。如果一个团队用「补发件数」考核售后，那么客服会倾向于用退款代替补发（因为退款不算补发件数）——即使补发对买家更好、对留存更好。如果用一个未经定义的「一次解决率」，那么最容易做的事（先退款、再让买家重新下单）会被算成一次解决，而真正解决问题的补发反而被算作两次触达。这一篇给出补发度量的口径设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个必须一起看的量\">核心概念：三个必须一起看的量</h2><p>补发的度量有三个维度，缺任何一个都会诱导出错误行为。</p>\n<p><strong>成本</strong>：补发是第二次履约，它的成本必须能被归集到原因上（漏发、错发、丢失、破损），而不只是一个售后总额。没有归因的成本无法改进——你不知道该优化打包流程还是该更换承运商。</p>\n<p><strong>时效</strong>：补发的价值有很大一部分来自速度。一个两周才到的补发件，买家在等待期间可能已经发起了争议，此时补发即使送到也已经产生了争议成本。因此时效不是体验指标，它是成本指标的前置变量。</p>\n<p><strong>一次解决率</strong>：它有多个可能定义，而定义的选择会直接改变团队行为。这是本篇最需要精确处理的量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>口径陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>单件补发净成本（按原因归因）</td>\n<td>把索赔回收计成已回收而非预计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效</td>\n<td>补发履约时长（P50/P90）</td>\n<td>只统计成功件，忽略失败重发的时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次解决</td>\n<td>需要精确定义</td>\n<td>定义不同会导致相反的行为激励</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一次解决率的三种定义\">一次解决率的三种定义</h2><p>「一次解决率」（First Contact Resolution）在售后场景里至少有三种定义，它们测的是不同的东西。</p>\n<p>定义 A：<strong>单次触达解决占比</strong>——买家在一次客服交互内得到终局处置的比例。这个定义的问题是把「先退款让买家重新下单」算作解决，因为它确实在一次交互内给了买家一个终局。</p>\n<p>定义 B：<strong>无需再次求助的订单占比</strong>——买家在处置完成后不再就同一订单发起求助。这个定义更贴近买家的真实体验，但依赖观察窗口：观察期太短会高估，太长会引入无关求助。</p>\n<p>定义 C：<strong>补发后不再需要二次补发的占比</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mtext>二次补发数</mtext><mtext>补发总数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\frac{\\text{二次补发数}}{\\text{补发总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">补发总数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">二次补发数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个定义测的是补发本身的质量（有没有发错、有没有再次丢失），口径最窄但最可控。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>FSR</mtext><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>订单</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>处置后 </mtext><mi>W</mi><mtext> 天内无同订单求助</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>有售后处置的订单</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FSR}_B = \\frac{\\#\\{\\text{订单}: \\text{处置后 } W \\text{ 天内无同订单求助}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{有售后处置的订单}\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FSR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有售后处置的订单</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订单</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">处置后</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天内无同订单求助</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>推荐的做法是<strong>同时上报 B 与 C</strong>，并把 A 排除。理由是 A 会产生明确的坏激励（鼓励用退款快速结案），B 反映买家体验但受观察窗口影响，C 反映履约质量且完全在运营可控范围内。同时看 B 与 C 能区分两类问题：B 低而 C 高说明问题在处置决策（该补发的没补发），B 高而 C 低说明问题在履约执行（补发本身在出问题）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[售后订单] --&gt; B{处置类型}&#10;  B --&gt;|补发| C[观察窗口 W]&#10;  B --&gt;|退款| C&#10;  B --&gt;|退货退款| C&#10;  C --&gt; D{窗口内是否再求助}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[计入 FSR_B]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[不计入]&#10;  B --&gt;|补发| G{是否有二次补发}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[计入 FSR_C]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[不计入]&#10;  E --&gt; J[按原因下钻]&#10;  H --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[售后订单] --&gt; B{处置类型}\n  B --&gt;|补发| C[观察窗口 W]\n  B --&gt;|退款| C\n  B --&gt;|退货退款| C\n  C --&gt; D{窗口内是否再求助}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[计入 FSR_B]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[不计入]\n  B --&gt;|补发| G{是否有二次补发}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[计入 FSR_C]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[不计入]\n  E --&gt; J[按原因下钻]\n  H --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"成本归因的台账结构\">成本归因的台账结构</h2><p>度量要实现「按原因下钻」，前提是成本可归因。第 3 章第 1 篇给出了成本对象（<code>reship_cost</code>），这一篇给出它的聚合视图与必要的口径修正。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW reship_cost_monthly AS&#10;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, c.incurred_at)          AS period,&#10;       r.disposition_reason                        AS reason_code,&#10;       sc.channel                                  AS channel,&#10;       count(DISTINCT c.request_id)                AS requests,&#10;       sum(c.amount_minor - c.recovered_minor) / 100.0 AS net_cost,&#10;       avg(c.amount_minor - c.recovered_minor) / 100.0 AS avg_cost_per_request,&#10;       sum(CASE WHEN c.recovery_state = &#39;CLAIM_OPEN&#39;&#10;                THEN c.amount_minor ELSE 0 END) / 100.0 AS pending_recovery&#10;FROM   reship_cost c&#10;JOIN   reship_request r USING (request_id)&#10;LEFT JOIN reship_channel sc ON sc.request_id = c.request_id&#10;GROUP  BY 1, 2, 3;&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ON reship_cost_monthly (period, reason_code, channel);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MATERIALIZED VIEW reship_cost_monthly </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">incurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">disposition_reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reason_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">request_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_minor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovered_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_minor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovered_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_cost_per_request,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovery_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLAIM_OPEN'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_minor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pending_recovery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   reship_cost c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   reship_request r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (request_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reship_channel sc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">request_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">request_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP  BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reship_cost_monthly (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason_code, channel);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pending_recovery</code> 被单独列出而不是并入 <code>net_cost</code>，这是一个刻意的口径选择。把「索赔已提交但未到账」的金额从净成本里扣掉，会让成本看起来更好而掩盖了回收率低的事实。正确做法是让 <code>net_cost</code> 只扣实际到账的金额，同时把在途索赔作为单独指标展示——这两个数字的比值本身就是承运人索赔流程健康度的指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>口径用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单件补发净成本</td>\n<td>(发生额 − 实际回收) / 补发请求数</td>\n<td>成本控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索赔回收率</td>\n<td>实际回收 / 索赔金额</td>\n<td>承运商管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索赔在途金额</td>\n<td>已提交未到账的金额</td>\n<td>现金流与流程健康</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放弃追回金额</td>\n<td>recovery_state = ABANDONED 的金额</td>\n<td>识别流程断点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时效的分位数而非均值\">时效的分位数而非均值</h2><p>补发时效必须用分位数而不是均值衡量，原因有两个。第一，分布是长尾的（少数跨境补发会拖到 30 天以上），均值会被长尾拉高到不代表任何具体订单的位置。第二，也是更重要的：<strong>买家感知与成本都由尾部决定</strong>。P90 的时长决定了有多少买家会在等待期间发起争议，而这个比例直接映射到争议率上。</p>\n<p>而争议率有一个外生的硬约束。Visa 的 VAMP 计划按月计算争议与欺诈的笔数、比率与金额，非合规档为 5 笔 / 0.5%，超额档在某些区域为 150 笔 / 2.2% / 7.5 万美元、其他区域为 1500 笔 / 1.5%；Mastercard 的 ECP 以 100–299 笔且比率 1.5%–2.99% 为 ECM、300 笔以上且比率 3% 为 HECM，罚金从第 2 个月起递增（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/monitoring-programs\">卡组织监控计划</a>）。这些门槛意味着：<strong>补发时效的 P90 与争议率之间存在可测的传导关系</strong>，因此时效不能在事后当成体验指标单独看。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT reason_code,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY hours_to_deliver) AS p50_h,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.9) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY hours_to_deliver) AS p90_h,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.99) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY hours_to_deliver) AS p99_h,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE disputed)::numeric&#10;         / nullif(count(*), 0)                                       AS dispute_rate&#10;FROM   reship_fulfilment_actuals&#10;WHERE  shipped_at &gt;= :period_start AND shipped_at &lt; :period_end&#10;GROUP  BY reason_code&#10;ORDER  BY p90_h DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reason_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hours_to_deliver) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p50_h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hours_to_deliver) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p90_h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hours_to_deliver) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p99_h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disputed)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   reship_fulfilment_actuals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipped_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipped_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reason_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p90_h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询把时效分位数与争议率放在一起输出，是为了让两者的相关性可以被直接观察，而不是靠两个团队各自汇报。<code>percentile_cont</code> 是连续插值版本，适合时长这类连续量；若希望结果落在实际观测值上，应改用 <code>percentile_disc</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标如何反向影响规则\">指标如何反向影响规则</h2><p>度量设计的最后一步是检查它会不会诱导坏行为。三个常见反例：</p>\n<p><strong>反例一：用「补发件数下降」考核。</strong> 结果是客服改用退款结案，短期补发件数下降，但退款成本与复购损失上升，且真实的履约问题（打包漏装、承运商丢失）因为不再表现为补发而被掩盖。</p>\n<p><strong>反例二：用「补发时效均值」考核。</strong> 结果是客服优先处理容易快速送达的补发（本地有货、近距离），而把困难的补发（跨境、需报关）排在后面，导致尾部更长、争议率更高。用 P90 考核能抑制这个行为。</p>\n<p><strong>反例三：用「一次解决率（定义 A）」考核。</strong> 结果是所有问题都被「一次交互内退款」解决，补发通道形同虚设，而第 2 章确立的「免费补救是义务」这条合规底线在实践中被绕过——用退款替代更换在若干市场是站不住的，见 <a href=\"../reship-decision-scenario/reship-vs-refund-decision-policy\">补发 vs 退款/退货的决策策略</a>。</p>\n<p>一个健康的指标组合应当同时包含<strong>结果指标</strong>（净成本、P90 时效）、<strong>质量指标</strong>（FSR_C、二次补发率）、<strong>约束指标</strong>（争议率、索赔回收率），并且在任何单一指标上都不设独立考核。这不是管理偏好，而是因为这三个类别各自都可以被单独优化到损害另外两类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标类别</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>被单独优化时的破坏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>净成本、P90 时效</td>\n<td>拒发补发、拖延处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>FSR_C、二次补发率</td>\n<td>只处理简单案子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束</td>\n<td>争议率、索赔回收率</td>\n<td>过度保守、拒绝一切加速通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>补发度量必须<strong>成本、时效、一次解决三者同看</strong>；缺任一项都会诱导出可预测的坏行为。</li>\n<li><strong>一次解决率有三种定义</strong>，应同时上报「无再次求助占比」与「无二次补发占比」，并排除「单次触达解决占比」（它会鼓励用退款快速结案）。</li>\n<li>成本台账中<strong>索赔在途金额与放弃追回金额要单独列出</strong>，不能并入净成本，否则会掩盖回收流程的断点。</li>\n<li>时效用<strong>分位数而非均值</strong>，P90 是关键量，因为它与争议率的传导关系是可测的。</li>\n<li>卡组织监控计划的门槛（Visa VAMP、Mastercard ECM/HECM）构成<strong>外生硬约束</strong>，且只统计争议发生数不计胜负，因此时效与争议率必须一起看。</li>\n<li>任何单一指标都不应独立考核；结果、质量、约束三类指标必须成套使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与其他篇的边界\">与其他篇的边界</h2><p>本篇只讲度量口径与台账结构。成本对象的字段设计见 <a href=\"../reship-cost-customs/reship-shipping-fault-attribution\">补发运费责任归属（平台/卖家/买家）</a>；防控规则带来的拦截量见 <a href=\"false-nondelivery-reship-abuse\">虚假未收到/重复补发薅羊毛防控</a>；原品处置产生的损失额见 <a href=\"original-item-return-or-abandon\">补发后原品回收/弃置处置</a>；加速通道对时效分位数的影响见 <a href=\"../reship-decision-scenario/reship-local-warehouse-fastpath\">本地仓直发/随箱补发快速通道</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"补发成本/SLA/一次解决率度量","id":"补发成本-sla-一次解决率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个必须一起看的量","id":"核心概念-三个必须一起看的量"},{"level":2,"text":"一次解决率的三种定义","id":"一次解决率的三种定义"},{"level":2,"text":"成本归因的台账结构","id":"成本归因的台账结构"},{"level":2,"text":"时效的分位数而非均值","id":"时效的分位数而非均值"},{"level":2,"text":"指标如何反向影响规则","id":"指标如何反向影响规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他篇的边界","id":"与其他篇的边界"}],"prev":{"title":"补发后原品回收/弃置处置（联126）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-fraud-recovery/original-item-return-or-abandon"},"next":null}